# Gmail Cleanup Project Structure

This is a **Next.js 15** application for Gmail cleanup functionality with **Better Auth** integration and **Drizzle ORM**.

## Core Architecture

- **Framework**: Next.js 15 with App Router and React 19
- **Authentication**: Better Auth with Google OAuth and Gmail API access
- **Database**: SQLite with Drizzle ORM
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4 with custom design system
- **UI Components**: Radix UI with custom styling via CVA
- **Build Tool**: Bun (see [package.json](mdc:package.json))
- **Linting**: TypeScript + Oxlint
- **Runtime**: Uses Turbopack for dev mode

## Project Structure

```
src/
├── app/                     # Next.js App Router pages and API routes
│   ├── (homepage)/          # Route group for homepage with shared layout
│   │   └── _components/     # Page-specific components (Header, Footer)
│   ├── api/                 # API routes
│   │   ├── auth/           # Authentication endpoints
│   │   └── gmail/          # Gmail API integration
│   ├── clean/              # Gmail cleanup interface
│   │   └── _components/    # Page-specific components
│   ├── layout.tsx          # Root layout with theme provider
│   └── globals.css         # Global styles and Tailwind base
├── components/             # Shared/reusable components
│   ├── ui/                # Base UI components (buttons, cards, etc.)
│   └── svgs/              # Custom SVG components
├── db/                    # Database layer
│   ├── index.ts           # Database connection and client
│   └── schema.ts          # Drizzle schema definitions
└── lib/                   # Utility libraries and configurations
    ├── auth.ts            # Better Auth configuration
    ├── auth-client.ts     # Client-side auth utilities
    ├── session.ts         # Session management utilities
    ├── env.ts             # Environment variables validation
    └── utils.ts           # General utilities (cn, etc.)
```

## Key Configuration Files

- [tsconfig.json](mdc:tsconfig.json) - TypeScript configuration with `@/*` path mapping
- [drizzle.config.ts](mdc:drizzle.config.ts) - Database configuration and migrations
- [components.json](mdc:components.json) - shadcn/ui component configuration
- [next.config.ts](mdc:next.config.ts) - Next.js configuration

## Database Schema

The database uses Better Auth's generated schema with user sessions and Google OAuth accounts. See [src/db/schema.ts](mdc:src/db/schema.ts) for the complete schema including user, session, account, and verification tables.
